{"about_the_game":"<strong>COMMAND MECHS, CONQUER MARS!</strong><br><br>Like strategy games but find build orders, resource management and base expansion daunting?<br><br>Space Gears takes the micromanaging out and allows you to prepare your resources and troops before the battle, so that when you're deployed on the Martian surface, you can focus on commanding your troops and  optimal strategy to win.<br><br>Developed by Korean game designers who are passionate about sci-fi and real-time strategy games, Space Gears is a next-generation strategy game set against the backdrop of Martian terraforming.<br><br>Lots of PvE and PvP battle modes are planned, so stay tuned!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2302770/extras/03830a75e32f32786fe76ae62eea52e6.poster.avif?t=1713506682\" width=624 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2302770/extras/03830a75e32f32786fe76ae62eea52e6.webm?t=1713506682\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2302770/extras/03830a75e32f32786fe76ae62eea52e6.mp4?t=1713506682\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>\u25c6  The Space Gears Universe</strong><br>The latter half of the 21st century sees the dawn a new age in space exploration beyond the confines of Earth and Luna. Humanity's future lies in Mars, where the success of the terraforming project depends on the pioneers and their mechs, known as &quot;Space Gears&quot;.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2302770/extras/77336fdb31998c4f3c5458a713d9300c.avif?t=1713506682\" width=616 height=250 /></span><br><br><strong>\u25c6  Space Gears</strong><br>&quot;Space Gears&quot; are mechs that can not only fight but also replace various labor tasks. There are many mech manufacturers, each offering various mechs with their unique characteristics. You can assemble your own mechs using their designs.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2302770/extras/21aee7d9d1f05b2d895ed120df840eef.poster.avif?t=1713506682\" width=624 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2302770/extras/21aee7d9d1f05b2d895ed120df840eef.webm?t=1713506682\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2302770/extras/21aee7d9d1f05b2d895ed120df840eef.mp4?t=1713506682\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>\u25c6 The Unknown</strong><br>Mars has many dangers. The harsh environment, rapidly changing weather, and mysterious phenomena all threaten to impede your efforts. Among them, the biggest danger are mechs infected with an unknown AI virus. You will need to explore Mars, seek out the source of the AI virus and eliminate it.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2302770/extras/ef36309fc12b52e59541cb2c63770f1f.avif?t=1713506682\" width=616 height=250 /></span>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2302770?t=1713506682","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2302770/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1713506682","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2302770/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1713506682","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2302770/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1713506682","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_descript